  "$comment": "MyVedicDay daily-guidance methodology: the app's own way of summarizing the five Panchanga limbs into simple daily guidance. It is NOT a universal traditional rule and is not a Muhurta calculation. Ratings are provisional, based on classical groupings (Nanda/Bhadra/Jaya/Rikta/Purna Tithis; Dhruva, Mridu, Kshipra, Chara, Mishra, Ugra, Tikshna Nakshatras; the nine malefic Yogas; Vishti Karana). Review with the reference astrologer; bump 'version' on every change. 'traditions' holds partial per-tradition overrides of 'default'. 'valueSelection': 'PredominantDaytime' rates the Tithi/Nakshatra/Yoga/Karana in force for most of the daytime (sunrise to sunset); 'Sunrise' rates the value at sunrise (the formal Panchang-day convention).",
